  VALUE: FRONTEND-REQUESTED-CORPUS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: QUAL-STOPGRID-002
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Actual native rows and honest supplemental scope
STATEMENT: >>>
Every retained engine sample shall map to a distinct ordered actual native row within a declared32-ULP time-rounding guard. No interpolation/extrapolation or missing observable may substitute for a row. All101 samples of four pinned root voltage/current identities shall retain units, finite values and the existing dimensional/relative tolerances. Reports shall retain complete axes, hashes, command/pause counts and native extra rows. Supplemental success shall not modify primary corpus statuses or claim unchanged native step history, complete equal grids, arbitrary-model accuracy or performance.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: FsCheck100 cases replay2399,20261103 challenge the32-ULP boundary; malformed and numerical-disagreement tests; fresh native and CLI replays preserve101 engine points,504 native points,403 extra native rows,99 pauses and maximum observed2ULP. All four observable errors are near roundoff. This pinned stateless sine/gain circuit does not establish RLC/nonlinear/storage/history parity. Evidence: evidence/stop-grid-poc.json. Future generalized instrumented oracle admission remains unqualified.
<<<
